---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Sidebar from '../components/Sidebar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import PublicationsList from '../components/PublicationsList.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
import Layout from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<Layout title = "About" description = "About">
  <p>
  Hi! I am a computer science and honors math major at the University of Michigan. I am currently most interested in reinforcement learning research and am working in <u><a href="https://leiying.engin.umich.edu/">Prof. Lei Ying's</a></u> lab. Specifically, I work on RLHF, Deep RL, and Sample Efficient RL. You can view my papers <u><a href="/publications">here</a></u>.
  </p>
  <br/>
  <p>
    I also work as an Instructional Aide for EECS 203 Discrete Math (Advanced Topics Section) and as a Grader for ECE 567 Reinforcement Learning Theory at UM.
  </p>
  <br/>
  <p>
  Take a look at my <u><a href="/blog">blog</a></u> where I write about math/cs things that interest me. Also check out my <u><a href="/techstack">tech stack</a></u> including my config/dotfiles for my NixOS/Hyprland setup.
  </p>
  <br/>
  <p>
  If you'd like to chat, please reach out to me at <b><u><a id="email" class="obf whitespace-nowrap" data-e="ZWFzc211c0B1bWljaC5lZHU=">ude [tod] hcimu [ta] sumssae</a></u></b>!
  </p>
  <style>
    .obf {
      unicode-bidi: bidi-override;
      direction: rtl;
    }
  </style>
  <script>
    const el = document.getElementById('email');
    if (el instanceof HTMLAnchorElement) {
      el.href = `mailto:${atob(el.dataset.e ?? '')}`;
    }
  </script>
  <br/>
  <PublicationsList />
</Layout>
